<title>USA: Carbide/Graphite chairman, CEO to retire.</title>
<headline>Carbide/Graphite chairman, CEO to retire.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carbide/Graphite Group Inc said on Monday Nicholas Kaiser, chairman and chief executive officer, has advised the board of directors that he intends to retire, upon selection of a successor and completion of a transition period.</p>
<p>Kaiser, who will remain a director, said he decided to retire for personal reasons and because the goals he had set for himself at the company had largely been accomplished.</p>
</text>
